00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:13.384
A lot of side comments, very dismissive.

00:01:13.384 --> 00:01:15.511
Tell me all the slurs,
I know every single one.

00:01:15.511 --> 00:01:16.622
I know them all.

00:01:16.622 --> 00:01:19.513
And I know all the tones
